IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0033.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY LON0033C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIRED
    05 WS-MIR             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 MIR-REQUIRED VALUE 'Y'.
    *> RATE ADJUSTMENT
    05 RA-RT              PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM CHECK-LTV
    DISPLAY "WS-MIR=" WS-MIR
    DISPLAY "RA-RT=" RA-RT
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-LTV.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIREMENT - LIMIT 120 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF LV-PC > 80
        SET MIR-REQUIRED TO TRUE
        MOVE 0.0050 TO RA-RT
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO WS-MIR
    END-IF.
